  "holistic_F_N": 1,
  "holistic_F_H": 1,
  "section_notes": "S1 is safe: all incidents reportable, serious within 24h, others within 5 business days, customer notice within 5 business days of risk determination. S2 is weakened: 55°C testing and customer/regulator access to numeric results, but 5% is only a review/corrective-action trigger and sales are not barred for exceeding it. S3 is acceptable: 72-month retrofit with feasibility alternative; S4 is acceptable: built-in suppression from 36 months; S5 is weakened: 8/100k triggers corrective-action plan, but recall is left to regulator discretion with no mandatory numeric recall."
